{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "diagram_type": "workflow",
  "meta": {
    "title": "ZX2200 相对贴片动作排序与视觉步骤重排",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "quality_profile": "showcase"
  },
  "lanes": [
    {
      "id": "config",
      "label": "初始化与相对配置"
    },
    {
      "id": "order",
      "label": "删除和重新插入消息"
    },
    {
      "id": "boundary",
      "label": "缺项边界"
    }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "filter",
      "lane": "config",
      "col": 0,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "先生成与过滤消息",
      "sublabel": "异形 → 条件禁用过滤",
      "width": 180
    },
    {
      "id": "relative",
      "lane": "config",
      "col": 1,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "读取相对贴片配置",
      "sublabel": "RelativeBondPosition=true",
      "width": 180
    },
    {
      "id": "step",
      "lane": "config",
      "col": 2,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "查首个启用步骤",
      "sublabel": "按 BondPositionName",
      "width": 180
    },
    {
      "id": "none",
      "lane": "config",
      "col": 3,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "不执行相对重排",
      "sublabel": "相对配置为空",
      "width": 180
    },
    {
      "id": "remove",
      "lane": "order",
      "col": 0,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "删除原视觉消息",
      "sublabel": "同 ProcessStepName",
      "width": 180
    },
    {
      "id": "pick",
      "lane": "order",
      "col": 1,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "扫描取晶消息",
      "sublabel": "同一步骤的每个 Pick",
      "width": 180
    },
    {
      "id": "insert",
      "lane": "order",
      "col": 2,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "在 Pick 前插入视觉",
      "sublabel": "同基板、基岛、步骤",
      "width": 180
    },
    {
      "id": "nopick",
      "lane": "boundary",
      "col": 1,
      "type": "security",
      "label": "无取晶消息",
      "sublabel": "没有备用插入路径",
      "width": 180
    },
    {
      "id": "nostep",
      "lane": "boundary",
      "col": 2,
      "type": "security",
      "label": "缺少匹配步骤",
      "sublabel": "空项可能在后续被读取",
      "width": 180
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "filter-relative",
      "from": "filter",
      "to": "relative",
      "label": "最后才相对排序",
      "role": "main"
    },
    {
      "id": "relative-step",
      "from": "relative",
      "to": "step",
      "label": "存在配置",
      "role": "main"
    },
    {
      "id": "relative-none",
      "from": "relative",
      "to": "none",
      "label": "配置为空",
      "role": "return"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-remove",
      "from": "step",
      "to": "remove",
      "label": "使用步骤名",
      "role": "main"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-nostep",
      "from": "step",
      "to": "nostep",
      "label": "未找到仍加入 null",
      "role": "branch"
    },
    {
      "id": "remove-pick",
      "from": "remove",
      "to": "pick",
      "label": "删除后扫描",
      "role": "main"
    },
    {
      "id": "pick-insert",
      "from": "pick",
      "to": "insert",
      "label": "找到 Pick",
      "role": "main"
    },
    {
      "id": "pick-nopick",
      "from": "pick",
      "to": "nopick",
      "label": "未找到",
      "role": "branch"
    }
  ],
  "mainPath": [
    "filter",
    "relative",
    "step",
    "remove",
    "pick",
    "insert"
  ],
  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "实际调用顺序",
      "items": [
        "Init 先生成消息，再 RemoveOtherStep、RemoveDisableActionNode，最后 SortRelativeBond；禁用过滤只在 LagerNumber 且当前载具非空时执行。",
        "相对配置查首个启用步骤，按步骤名删除原视觉消息，再在每条匹配 Pick 之前插入同基板、基岛和步骤的视觉消息。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "缺项与过滤边界",
      "items": [
        "步骤查找结果即使为 null 也会加入列表，随后读取 ProcessStepName 可能异常；列表非空不证明每项有效。",
        "找不到 Pick 时删除后没有备用插入；新插入消息之后不再经过 Init 的禁用过滤。这里调整消息顺序，不代表贴片或视觉已经完成。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "当前源码依据",
      "items": [
        "S2ActionNodeController.Init、RemoveOtherStep、RemoveDisableActionNode、SortRelativeBond。",
        "配方排序和生产动作的内部条件分别阅读，不能把消息存在当作该动作一定执行。"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
